{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "魔鬼鱼的反击手段  (Manta Ray Strikes Back)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 15 of Behind the Scenes. When an artist's agent barges into Xingtian demanding special treatment for his spoiled client, Chun Yuqiao calmly turns the tables with hotel security footage. Listen to their Mandarin confrontation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "体面一点说话，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经找了心理医生帮她，但她恐怕暂时没法工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她恐水这个事，你们经纪公司不应该瞒着我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你是故意的吧？你在设计我呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你应该清楚的，我从来不讨价还价。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你赶紧把医生撤了，让他老老实实地去录节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "以后所有的拍摄计划，必须提前给我先看过！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就先选个网站吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要是这条视频不经意流露出去了，各大门户网站应该都会很感兴趣。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你敢勒索我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "路条网怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "都说你是魔鬼鱼，我今天领教了，明天我就带人入组。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "很好，门在那边。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "体面一点说话，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Speak with a bit of decency, alright?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经找了心理医生帮她，但她恐怕暂时没法工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have already found a therapist to help her, though she probably cannot work for now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她恐水这个事，你们经纪公司不应该瞒着我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your agency never should have hidden her fear of water from us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你是故意的吧？你在设计我呢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You did this on purpose, right? You are setting a trap for me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你应该清楚的，我从来不讨价还价。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You ought to know clearly that I never haggle.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你赶紧把医生撤了，让他老老实实地去录节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pull the doctor off right now and let him record the show obediently.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "以后所有的拍摄计划，必须提前给我先看过！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From now on, every shooting plan must be shown to me in advance!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就先选个网站吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In that case, go ahead and pick a website first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要是这条视频不经意流露出去了，各大门户网站应该都会很感兴趣。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If this video clip slipped out by accident, every major web portal would be very interested.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你敢勒索我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You dare blackmail me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "路条网怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How does Lutiao sound?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "都说你是魔鬼鱼，我今天领教了，明天我就带人入组。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone calls you Manta Ray, and today I have seen it firsthand; tomorrow I will bring my other artist onto the crew.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "很好，门在那边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Very good; the door is right over there.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "体面一点说话，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我已经找了心理医生帮她，但她恐怕暂时没法工作了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她恐水这个事，你们经纪公司不应该瞒着我们。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你是故意的吧？你在设计我呢！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你应该清楚的，我从来不讨价还价。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你赶紧把医生撤了，让他老老实实地去录节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "以后所有的拍摄计划，必须提前给我先看过！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就先选个网站吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要是这条视频不经意流露出去了，各大门户网站应该都会很感兴趣。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你敢勒索我？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "路条网怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "都说你是魔鬼鱼，我今天领教了，明天我就带人入组。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "很好，门在那边。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Faced with footage that Lutiao would gladly publish, the agent backs down and agrees to send his sidelined star to join the shoot tomorrow. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
